(4691310, 676635, 77196, '<td valign="top">The sun is over-blown and looks WAY over-processed. Don''t know if this is straight from camera, or if it happened post-proc, but it is really bad. It is really too bad, because otherwise this shot is gorgeous - nice definition on the clouds, nice capture of bird in flight, and silhouette of the tree. Nice line of hills in background bottom left. Without the problems with the sun, this would be a 7 or 8 from me.</td>', 'The sun is over-blown and looks WAY over-processed. Don''t know if this is straight from camera, or if it happened post-proc, but it is really bad. It is really too bad, because otherwise this shot is gorgeous - nice definition on the clouds, nice capture of bird in flight, and silhouette of the tree. Nice line of hills in background bottom left. Without the problems with the sun, this would be a 7 or 8 from me.', '2008-05-08 21:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
