(4694714, 676148, 36006, '<td valign="top">this is more abstract than anything.<br/> <br/>the reason I say this is because I have no clue what you are trying to convey.<br/> <br/>as a viewer, my eye is not focused on anything except what you are calling the Sun.<br/> <br/>Your reflection in the window is evident as well, and not appealing.<br/> <br/>It is hard for me to give you even a mid range score on this image.<br/> <br/>Try again.</td>', 'this is more abstract than anything. the reason I say this is because I have no clue what you are trying to convey. as a viewer, my eye is not focused on anything except what you are calling the Sun. Your reflection in the window is evident as well, and not appealing. It is hard for me to give you even a mid range score on this image. Try again.', '2008-05-11 11:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
