(4695325, 676409, 13759, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W and the sun is hard thing to do. Some people gets it very weel. But many tries out with failing results. To do this is need reaaly to astonish the observer with more tham simple elements, like a skyline and the sun.<br/>Let''s think:<br/>1 - Sun in B&amp;W is only a white circle.<br/>2 - The great colors os sky are surpassed to greyscale<br/>3 - the scene is a lot of inclination that show disattention to details, and to do B&amp;W the details are the key.<br/> <br/>Think in B&amp;W as a very great show of multiples constrastant elements. Replace colors by the delight of tones. How more hard/soft tones you catch in one scene great will be the result.</td>', 'B&W and the sun is hard thing to do. Some people gets it very weel. But many tries out with failing results. To do this is need reaaly to astonish the observer with more tham simple elements, like a skyline and the sun.Let''s think:1 - Sun in B&W is only a white circle.2 - The great colors os sky are surpassed to greyscale3 - the scene is a lot of inclination that show disattention to details, and to do B&W the details are the key. Think in B&W as a very great show of multiples constrastant elements. Replace colors by the delight of tones. How more hard/soft tones you catch in one scene great will be the result.', '2008-05-11 22:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
