(4698304, 676235, 90414, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the power line detracts. A bit dark, too.</td>', 'Nice, but the power line detracts. A bit dark, too.', '2008-05-12 23:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698314, 676409, 10818, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky with the sun coming through.<br/>Nice ripple lines in the sand.<br/>The photo seems a bit tilted, and the power lines don''t do the shot any favors.</td>', 'Beautiful sky with the sun coming through.Nice ripple lines in the sand.The photo seems a bit tilted, and the power lines don''t do the shot any favors.', '2008-05-12 23:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698345, 676681, 10818, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, great sun rays and perspective.<br/>I am sure there is comments about the frame.  I don''t hate it, but it does not work so well with such a vertical shot.  You cant see the entire frame without scrolling up and down, that makes it tough to enjoy the shot completely.</td>', 'Cool shot, great sun rays and perspective.I am sure there is comments about the frame.  I don''t hate it, but it does not work so well with such a vertical shot.  You cant see the entire frame without scrolling up and down, that makes it tough to enjoy the shot completely.', '2008-05-12 23:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698354, 675607, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is fabulous.<br/>Brilliant composure, action and colors.</td>', 'That is fabulous.Brilliant composure, action and colors.', '2008-05-12 23:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698364, 675933, 10818, '<td valign="top">Quite simple, but really well done.<br/>Nice job keeping the great texture of the plant with the sun in your face.</td>', 'Quite simple, but really well done.Nice job keeping the great texture of the plant with the sun in your face.', '2008-05-12 23:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
