(4700210, 674641, 81664, '<td valign="top">The horizon is crooked. I don''t know if it was intentional. It probably would have looked better either straight or drastically unlevel. It is kind of in between. Too bad, it is a lovely scene!</td>', 'The horizon is crooked. I don''t know if it was intentional. It probably would have looked better either straight or drastically unlevel. It is kind of in between. Too bad, it is a lovely scene!', '2008-05-13 22:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
