(4703085, 675152, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhh Romil!!!   My heart hurts for you!  Darn!   A ribbon with such a beautiful, award-worthy photo -- on your 2nd challenge and to have it taken away.  Sniffle sniffle.   I had a ribbon photo dq''d once too, only mine was for editing (hangs head in shame). . .so I know how bad it makes you feel!<br/> <br/>But you keep entering shots like this -- and you will have many ribbons in your future.  You are amazingly talented for 19!<br/> <br/>EDIT:  Oooops. . .I just read Brad''s comment where he busted you for entering a photo that you intentionally knew was taken a year ago.   Hmmmmm.   I think maybe my heart still hurts.   But in disappointment now :(    <br/> <br/> <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-14 23:06:39.</i></td>', 'Ohhhhhh Romil!!!   My heart hurts for you!  Darn!   A ribbon with such a beautiful, award-worthy photo -- on your 2nd challenge and to have it taken away.  Sniffle sniffle.   I had a ribbon photo dq''d once too, only mine was for editing (hangs head in shame). . .so I know how bad it makes you feel! But you keep entering shots like this -- and you will have many ribbons in your future.  You are amazingly talented for 19! EDIT:  Oooops. . .I just read Brad''s comment where he busted you for entering a photo that you intentionally knew was taken a year ago.   Hmmmmm.   I think maybe my heart still hurts.   But in disappointment now :(      ', '2008-05-14 23:01:25.000000', '2008-05-15 00:06:39.000000', 0),
(4703193, 676706, 88136, '<td valign="top">this reminds me of a photo by this one national geographic photographer. i cant remember his name but i watched a movie on him and this is like one of his "ta da" photos</td>', 'this reminds me of a photo by this one national geographic photographer. i cant remember his name but i watched a movie on him and this is like one of his "ta da" photos', '2008-05-14 23:33:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4703237, 676763, 70514, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the sun coming through the leaves like this.  I actually tried a similar set up but with a blooming tree.  Not as nice as this.  For me, I''d like a tighter crop without the limbs in the left upper corner.  But that is just me. Great detail and lovely conversion.</td>', 'I absolutely love the sun coming through the leaves like this.  I actually tried a similar set up but with a blooming tree.  Not as nice as this.  For me, I''d like a tighter crop without the limbs in the left upper corner.  But that is just me. Great detail and lovely conversion.', '2008-05-14 23:43:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4703308, 676595, 69464, '<td valign="top">Well I rushed my very first entry and didn''t properly adjust levels, col. curves etc.  <br/> <br/>This image is part of a series that make up an HDR set....  much better view.<br/> <br/>I''ll try better next time.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-14 23:13:42.</i></td>', 'Well I rushed my very first entry and didn''t properly adjust levels, col. curves etc.   This image is part of a series that make up an HDR set....  much better view. I''ll try better next time.', '2008-05-15 00:12:36.000000', '2008-05-15 00:13:42.000000', 0),
