(4703328, 675590, 69008, '<td valign="top">It''s a bummer that you didn''t shoot this in the right time frame for the "Dappled Light" challenge.  It''s a pretty place, and photographed with nice style.</td>', 'It''s a bummer that you didn''t shoot this in the right time frame for the "Dappled Light" challenge.  It''s a pretty place, and photographed with nice style.', '2008-05-15 00:24:44.000000', NULL, 0),
