(4703498, 676609, 52549, '<td valign="top">I agree with Sandy on this beautiful photo, it certainly deserves its ribbon. Congratulations, Terry.</td>', 'I agree with Sandy on this beautiful photo, it certainly deserves its ribbon. Congratulations, Terry.', '2008-05-15 01:51:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4703524, 676148, 72103, '<td valign="top">Good to see you still shooting buddy, I liked it a lot.  It''s a difficult call to make each week, do I submit something I like, knowing it''ll probably bomb with the massess, or do I shoot for score ( you know, flowers, blobs of water etc etc ).</td>', 'Good to see you still shooting buddy, I liked it a lot.  It''s a difficult call to make each week, do I submit something I like, knowing it''ll probably bomb with the massess, or do I shoot for score ( you know, flowers, blobs of water etc etc ).', '2008-05-15 02:11:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4703563, 676767, 65035, '<td valign="top">Ohh but I woke up thinking about this picture this morning so it left an impression. I love the rays and flares on the sun  and I do like these really busy, almost abstract shots. They don''t tend to score well (at least mine don''t) and I think it''s because they look great in full size and would probably be great printed at about A4 or larger but compressed down to the itty bitty size here they get too confusing. But I think it''s nice.</td>', 'Ohh but I woke up thinking about this picture this morning so it left an impression. I love the rays and flares on the sun  and I do like these really busy, almost abstract shots. They don''t tend to score well (at least mine don''t) and I think it''s because they look great in full size and would probably be great printed at about A4 or larger but compressed down to the itty bitty size here they get too confusing. But I think it''s nice.', '2008-05-15 03:07:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4703566, 676706, 54634, '<td valign="top">One thing , though i love the image, but is that really the sun&gt;?</td>', 'One thing , though i love the image, but is that really the sun>?', '2008-05-15 03:09:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4703649, 675543, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot</td>', 'Very nice shot', '2008-05-15 04:14:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4703698, 675139, 56332, '<td valign="top">thanks. it''s barbecue smoke, hence the title.</td>', 'thanks. it''s barbecue smoke, hence the title.', '2008-05-15 06:34:58.000000', NULL, 0),
