(4704371, 676832, 9462, '<td valign="top">Hi Barbara! I thoroughly enjoyed the uniqueness of your photo during the challenge voting period. This image was a candidate for one of my UpsyDaisy awards, it was not an easy choice. Since the DQ, I figure I should give you your rightful recognition. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=670652" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670652.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670652.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670652.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Hi Barbara! I thoroughly enjoyed the uniqueness of your photo during the challenge voting period. This image was a candidate for one of my UpsyDaisy awards, it was not an easy choice. Since the DQ, I figure I should give you your rightful recognition. ', '2008-05-15 13:00:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4704589, 675152, 42171, '<td valign="top">Picture was only "OK" in my opinion. Very surprised to see it grace the front page.<br/> <br/>Shame you had to cheat to get it there.<br/> <br/>I wonder if the editing steps for this one year old shot were actually legal anyway?<br/>Something about the bottom being so dark and the top being so bright that doesn''t look right to me...</td>', 'Picture was only "OK" in my opinion. Very surprised to see it grace the front page. Shame you had to cheat to get it there. I wonder if the editing steps for this one year old shot were actually legal anyway?Something about the bottom being so dark and the top being so bright that doesn''t look right to me...', '2008-05-15 14:44:09.000000', NULL, 0),
