(4707985, 675152, 3746, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Brad:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by romil:</b></div><hr/><i> Aaargh...my camera dates were faulty!!!<br/>god this hurts! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Except for one minor detail:<br/> <br/>This image was uploaded to <a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/romilbhansali/1474980260/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Flickr</a> also:<br/>* Taken with a Sony DSC-T50.<br/>* Taken on March 24, 2007<br/>* Uploaded on October 2, 2007<br/> <br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL, busted! Nicely spotted Brad..  he has gone a bit quiet now ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by Brad: Originally posted by romil: Aaargh...my camera dates were faulty!!!god this hurts!  Except for one minor detail: This image was uploaded to Flickr also:* Taken with a Sony DSC-T50.* Taken on March 24, 2007* Uploaded on October 2, 2007   LOL, busted! Nicely spotted Brad..  he has gone a bit quiet now ;-)', '2008-05-17 04:52:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4708466, 676371, 27373, '<td valign="top">The colors are good, really nice capture of the sun as an orb.  You got one or two comments regarding the negative space.  Personally, I don''t mind it so much.  I probably would have cropped more off the bottom and left just the power line with a thin line of ground at the bottom.</td>', 'The colors are good, really nice capture of the sun as an orb.  You got one or two comments regarding the negative space.  Personally, I don''t mind it so much.  I probably would have cropped more off the bottom and left just the power line with a thin line of ground at the bottom.', '2008-05-17 17:19:59.000000', NULL, 0),
