(4712857, 676706, 66635, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I think you should have won the blue, though.  The one that did win was an admittedly very beautiful photo; but it does not appear to me to actually have the sun in the frame.  Yours clearly does.  Nice use of rule of thirds and leading lines.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I think you should have won the blue, though.  The one that did win was an admittedly very beautiful photo; but it does not appear to me to actually have the sun in the frame.  Yours clearly does.  Nice use of rule of thirds and leading lines.', '2008-05-20 11:04:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4712877, 675607, 66635, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully vivid color, and I like the leading line of the woman and her cloth.</td>', 'Wonderfully vivid color, and I like the leading line of the woman and her cloth.', '2008-05-20 11:08:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4713385, 676767, 65319, '<td valign="top">The silhouette leaves create quite an impression of kaleidoscopic or geometric fractals of shapes and figures!  I love the star rays of the sun with the frame of the trees!  I''m disappointed not to see this one score higher and feel the voters really underrated this photo.</td>', 'The silhouette leaves create quite an impression of kaleidoscopic or geometric fractals of shapes and figures!  I love the star rays of the sun with the frame of the trees!  I''m disappointed not to see this one score higher and feel the voters really underrated this photo.', '2008-05-20 18:34:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4714118, 676652, 39427, '<td valign="top">this is a very pretty shot, and I love the way the image is pretty evenly divided into 3 horizontal tiers.  I think it would have more impact if you smoothed out the colors with a noise reduction program like Neat Image, and if you used some curves work to get that middle layer a bit less muddy.  Good luck in the future!</td>', 'this is a very pretty shot, and I love the way the image is pretty evenly divided into 3 horizontal tiers.  I think it would have more impact if you smoothed out the colors with a noise reduction program like Neat Image, and if you used some curves work to get that middle layer a bit less muddy.  Good luck in the future!', '2008-05-21 03:28:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4714121, 676652, 39427, '<td valign="top">also, I tested it out on my computer, I think if you crop a bit off the top the 3 tiers appear more even... give it a try!</td>', 'also, I tested it out on my computer, I think if you crop a bit off the top the 3 tiers appear more even... give it a try!', '2008-05-21 03:37:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4714198, 676217, 48228, '<td valign="top">A much tighter crop would have helped this one to score better.....</td>', 'A much tighter crop would have helped this one to score better.....', '2008-05-21 05:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4714206, 676468, 48228, '<td valign="top">I also like the silhouette of the tree on the left, and maybe a tighter crop, without the pole and wires on the right.<br/> <br/>I love the golden glow that you have captured, as it is just stunning. <br/> <br/>I also like to see you practice on taking silhouette images whenever you can as they can be so visual to the eye. <br/> <br/>Take you time, enjoy what you do, and like me enjoy the wonderful friendships one can make at DPC.</td>', 'I also like the silhouette of the tree on the left, and maybe a tighter crop, without the pole and wires on the right. I love the golden glow that you have captured, as it is just stunning.  I also like to see you practice on taking silhouette images whenever you can as they can be so visual to the eye.  Take you time, enjoy what you do, and like me enjoy the wonderful friendships one can make at DPC.', '2008-05-21 05:26:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4714399, 675970, 21500, '<td valign="top">I''m shocked this didn''t do better, Joe - great shot.</td>', 'I''m shocked this didn''t do better, Joe - great shot.', '2008-05-21 08:41:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4714652, 675782, 48228, '<td valign="top">Blue is my favorite color, so I was drawn to this one immediately..... <br/>Lovely composition, and almost a silhouette in color version..... <br/>I love the different layers of blue very much. <br/>In all, a very pleasing image.....</td>', 'Blue is my favorite color, so I was drawn to this one immediately..... Lovely composition, and almost a silhouette in color version..... I love the different layers of blue very much. In all, a very pleasing image.....', '2008-05-21 10:39:06.000000', NULL, 0),
