(4719057, 676135, 67258, '<td valign="top">Quiche - thanks for providing the set-up details for this.  I am always interested in discovering how a photographer went about achieving a shot that has intrigued me, and this one certainly did!  I am glad that it was taken in the field, rather than a studio - it was only after I had viewed a few times that I began to wonder, hence the addition to my comment during voting.</td>', 'Quiche - thanks for providing the set-up details for this.  I am always interested in discovering how a photographer went about achieving a shot that has intrigued me, and this one certainly did!  I am glad that it was taken in the field, rather than a studio - it was only after I had viewed a few times that I began to wonder, hence the addition to my comment during voting.', '2008-05-23 05:39:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4719833, 675607, 92228, '<td valign="top">WOW!  You did an amazing job with this pic!  I wouldn''t want anything changed!</td>', 'WOW!  You did an amazing job with this pic!  I wouldn''t want anything changed!', '2008-05-23 13:48:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4720075, 676763, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m impressed with your clever six pointed no filter star!  I''m drawn to the distant branches - those that get to frolic in the sun while the leaves closer seem to be missing out on the fun.</td>', 'I''m impressed with your clever six pointed no filter star!  I''m drawn to the distant branches - those that get to frolic in the sun while the leaves closer seem to be missing out on the fun.', '2008-05-23 15:21:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4720127, 675970, 30982, '<td valign="top">Incredibly crisp detail, particularly the weathervane.  And the sun definitely has a presence here - I can''t think of a better way to describe it.  And whatever is out of focus simply adds texture to my eye - doesn''t bother me a bit.  Sometimes "clean" can be too clean.</td>', 'Incredibly crisp detail, particularly the weathervane.  And the sun definitely has a presence here - I can''t think of a better way to describe it.  And whatever is out of focus simply adds texture to my eye - doesn''t bother me a bit.  Sometimes "clean" can be too clean.', '2008-05-23 15:57:35.000000', NULL, 0),
