(4721478, 675152, 71489, '<td valign="top">Alright..didn''t have an internet connection so couldnt reply to all those posts down there..<br/>first of all...the picture is taken from a dsc-t50 i agree..but dunno y it''s not there in the dpchallenge camera list..dsc-t10 is similar with a similar resolution (7.2 MP)..hence i thought i''d go with it..<br/>secondly...this one''s for pix-al..the picture is 100% authentic..i''ve not violated the editing rules.. even the dp guys didnt have a problem with the editing..it''s a simple brightness contrast and cuves adjustment..it''s just that the picture was taken earlier than the challenge and being my second challenge i must''ve overlooked that detail..<br/>will take care of it in the future..and i seriously feel it was carelesness on my part and not cheating...</td>', 'Alright..didn''t have an internet connection so couldnt reply to all those posts down there..first of all...the picture is taken from a dsc-t50 i agree..but dunno y it''s not there in the dpchallenge camera list..dsc-t10 is similar with a similar resolution (7.2 MP)..hence i thought i''d go with it..secondly...this one''s for pix-al..the picture is 100% authentic..i''ve not violated the editing rules.. even the dp guys didnt have a problem with the editing..it''s a simple brightness contrast and cuves adjustment..it''s just that the picture was taken earlier than the challenge and being my second challenge i must''ve overlooked that detail..will take care of it in the future..and i seriously feel it was carelesness on my part and not cheating...', '2008-05-24 14:49:26.000000', NULL, 0),
